// The Passage Test plant: look() for shape 871.
//
// WHY THIS CLASS IS PINNED TO 871. The engine picks the usecode class for
// an item's events from its SHAPE NUMBER (`uint32 class_id = _shape`,
// item.cpp:1516), so shape 871's look() lands in class 871, as the
// elixir's lands in 868 (ELIXIR.UNK). `lv_manifest.json` pins
// TYPETESTPLANT to 871. Decided on 2026-10-11 (docs/art-track.md
// contract 13).
//
// WHY NOT TypePoisonPlant. The 1994 class for this plant is
// TESTPLAN.UNK's TypePoisonPlant, whose look() barks "Strange plant"
// (LOST VALE/TESTPLAN.UNK:20). It is compiled and pinned at class 1436,
// where no item can dispatch it, and manifest pins never renumber. Its
// use() runs the Passage Test scene, which the restoration runs from
// EggPlantTest instead (lv-patched/PLNTST.UNK), so a double-click on the
// plant must not start it. This class carries the 1994 look() alone.
//
// THE ITEM. The Test Plant on Map 10's test grounds (quality 10) and the
// five PLNTST pops after it, all TypeShortmushroom, which resolves to 871
// in u8c_symbols TYPE_SHAPES. Until 2026-10-11 it was shape 126 frame 0,
// a blue-crystal ground tile.

uses "item";

typeclass TypeTestPlant inherits Item
{
	process look();
}

process TypeTestPlant::look()
{
	bark("Strange plant");
}
